          "type": "Float",
          "default": "1"
        },
        {
          "name": "Strain",
          "type": "Float",
          "default": "0"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Apply an internal strain to specific piece of the geometry collection\n@param ItemIndex item index ( from HitResult) of the piece to apply strain on\n@param Location world location of where to apply the strain\n@param Radius radius from the location point to apply the strain to ( using the center of mass of the pieces )\n@param PropagationDepth How many level of connection to follow to propagate the strain through\n@param PropagationFactor when using propagation, the factor to multiply the strain from one level to the other, allowing falloff effect\n@param Strain strain / damage to apply"
